### Include this code
Add the code chunk below to your **worked_example.qmd** Quarto document to filter, de-duplicate and then rename columns in the bird_breeding_sites data frame.



::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
bird_breeding_selected <- bird_breeding_sites |>
  select(Site, Longitude, Latitude) |>
  distinct() |>
  rename(Breeding_Longitude = Longitude, Breeding_Latitude = Latitude)

gt(bird_breeding_selected)
```

